units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p f
atom_style atomic
lattice bcc 3.3 orient x 1 0 0 orient y 0 1 0 orient z 0 0 1
region whole block 0 66 0 66 -3.3 216.3 units box
create_box 1 whole
region target block 0 66 0 66 0 132 units box
region projectile block 0 66 0 66 147 213 units box
create_atoms 1 region target
create_atoms 1 region projectile
mass 1 92.90638
group target region target
group projectile region projectile
pair_style eam/fs
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
timestep 0.001
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step time temp pe ke etotal press pxx pyy pzz lx ly lz atoms
velocity all create 300 123456 dist gaussian mom yes rot no units box
fix equil all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
run 100000
reset_timestep 0
velocity projectile set 0 0 -20 sum yes units box
fix impact all nve
run 100000
